her finite places are passengers. Congruence\n  mechanisms outside the language do not exist.\n- HIDDEN-CHANNEL TEST (null): 2800 depth-23 {1,2}-survivors below\n  2^22 vs size-matched controls: omega 2.480/2.478, squarefree\n  0.806/0.815 (odd-integer constant 8/pi^2 = 0.811), P[3|n]\n  0.334/0.319, P[prime] 0.144/0.144. No multiplicative channel.\n  Falsification criterion stated: any statistic outside the language\n  predicting survival beyond its CRT projection.\n- INSTRUCTIVE ARTIFACT: naive lag-1 letter correlation +0.021 on\n  2^42 seeds = absorption tail of the trivial cycle (+1 ghost);\n  pre-absorption windows give -0.003 +- 0.003. Apparent\n  unfaithfulness was a framework prediction.\n- DIRECTION OF FLOW: table of forall-integer theorems (dichotomy,\n  log dwell, escape rate, upcrossings, clocks, supply, exact counts,\n  entropy deficit, Haar iid) - the load-bearing results are\n  Tao-direction universal statements; profile-narrowing is their\n  complement, i.e. presentation.\n- LANGUAGE-INVARIANCE: three independent frameworks (Tao, Chang,\n  ours) translate term-for-term and hit the SAME residual wall -\n  the obstruction is a property of the dynamics, not the framework.\n  Honesty note: c_suite's measured exact-vs-annealed gaps concern\n  stochastic heuristics, which no unconditional theorem uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1 && git push origin main 2>&1 | tail -1\ncd shadow_frontier && ailog add --tool claude-code --level-hint 1 --text \"FAITHFULNESS AUDIT (notes/faithfulness.tex, search/faithfulness.py, pushed) answering referee: is the finite-shadow language a faithful compression? (1) LOSSLESS: word coding = Bernstein-Lagarias conjugacy onto full shift (4845/4845 words = one class each, mass 0.9987; marginals exactly 2^-k); blind spot = exactly the subset N in Z_2, imported via 4 explicit exact interfaces (clocks/counting/drift/Baker). (2) COMPLETE on finite-modulus bounded windows: k-point factorization through (x mod Q, letters) 2000/2000; keystone identity all characters; CRT orthogonality: cylinders exactly uniform mod odd m - only the 2-adic place feeds the word. (3) HIDDEN-CHANNEL TEST NULL: depth-23 survivors vs controls match on omega/squarefree(8/pi^2)/3|n/primality - no multiplicative mechanism outside the language; falsification criterion shipped. (4) Artifact documented: +0.021 letter autocorrelation = trivial-cycle absorption tail; pre-absorption -0.003+-0.003. (5) Flow direction: load-bearing theorems are forall-integer (dichotomy, dwell, escape, upcrossings, clocks, supply, exact counts, entropy deficit, Haar iid); profile = complement. (6) Language-invariance: Tao/Chang/ours translate term-for-term, same wall => obstruction is dynamics-intrinsic. Verdict: faithful = lossless + complete-on-declared-categories + explicitly-isolated residual; all three verified.\" 2>&1 | tail -1 && ailog validate 2>&1 | tail -1","input_hash":"sha256:2340ea88b755b865455dbf4ac7818deece5f62998e7192f18baaa89b4ffff920","output_hash":"sha256:4b0f40ba35cccffeb37fe7166c331e5597f3a123d69689a6751fa9dc47f4e08a","tool":"Bash"},"time":"2026-06-11T03:14:53Z"},{"actor":{"kind":"ai_tool","tool":"Claude Code"},"event_type":"file_edited","materiality_hint":{"possible_claim_effect":true,"possible_code_effect":true},"target":{"after_hash":"sha256:486b29584c18b2ab8402139da5d49d7b9610defe406ca7c958234a6694af0935","input_hash":"sha256:58d9e41038a4cbce73a8966f0f8d4234fe924a38e36613b86a5803bcff3f2ffe","output_hash":"sha256:043002bf3b6c6b69d2c9238046d9d9d1a8c4ddfeb531fdae2b10549a5b004867","path":"/home/john/.claude/projects/-home-john-mynotes/memory/project_shadow_frontier.md","tool":"Edit"},"time":"2026-06-11T03:15:12Z"}]